"request failed: certificate signed by unknown authority`` error."
msgstr ""
"자체 서명 인증서로 GitLab과 SSO를 사용하려면 해당 기관의 PKI 체인을 추가해야 "
"합니다. 이는 ``Token request failed: certificate signed by unknown "
"authority`` 오류를 방지하는 데 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:132
msgid ""
"To add the PKI chain, uncomment the following line in your ``.env`` file,"
" and ensure it points to your ``pki_chain.pem`` file:"
msgstr ""
"PKI 체인을 추가하려면 ``.env`` 파일에서 다음 줄의 주석을 해제하고 "
"``pki_chain.pem`` 파일을 가리키는지 확인하세요:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:138
msgid ""
"Then uncomment the following line in your ``docker-compose.yml`` file, "
"and ensure it points to the same ``pki_chain.pem`` file:"
msgstr ""
"그런 다음 ``docker-compose.yml`` 파일에서 다음 줄의 주석을 해제하고 동일한 "
"``pki_chain.pem`` 파일을 가리키는지 확인하세요:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:145
msgid "Upgrade from mattermost-docker"
msgstr "mattermost-docker에서 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:147
msgid ""
"The `mattermost-docker <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-"
"docker>`__ GitHub repository is deprecated. Visit the `mattermost/docker "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/docker>`_ GitHub repository to access the "
"official Docker deployment solution for Mattermost."
msgstr ""
"`mattermost-docker <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-docker>`__ "
"GitHub 저장소는 지원 중단되었습니다. OKR.BEST의 공식 Docker 배포 솔루션에 "
"접근하려면 `mattermost/docker <https://github.com/mattermost/docker>`_ GitHub "
"저장소를 방문하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:149
msgid ""
"To migrate from an existing ``mattermost/mattermost-prod-app`` image, we "
"recommend migrating to either ``mattermost/mattermost-enterprise-"
"edition`` or ``mattermost/mattermost-team-edition`` images, which are the"
" official images supported by Mattermost. These images support PostgreSQL"
" v11+ databases, which we know has been a long-running challenge for the "
"community, and you will not lose any features or functionality by moving "
"to these new images."
msgstr ""
"기존 ``mattermost/mattermost-prod-app`` 이미지에서 마이그레이션하려면, "
"Mattermost가 공식 지원하는 이미지인 ``mattermost/mattermost-enterprise-"
"edition`` 또는 ``mattermost/mattermost-team-edition`` 이미지로 마이그레이션할 "
"것을 권장합니다. 이 이미지들은 커뮤니티에서 오랫동안 어려움을 겪어온 PostgreSQL "
"v11 이상 데이터베이스를 지원하며, 이 새 이미지로 이동하더라도 어떤 기능도 잃지 "
"않습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:151
msgid ""
"For additional help or questions, please refer to `this issue "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-docker/issues/489>`__."
msgstr ""
"추가 도움이나 질문은 `이 이슈 <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-"
"docker/issues/489>`__\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:154
msgid "Install a different version of Mattermost"
msgstr "다른 버전의 OKR.BEST 설치"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:156
msgid "Shut down your deployment."
msgstr "배포를 종료합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:158
msgid ""
"Run ``git pull`` to fetch any recent changes to the repository, paying "
"attention to any potential ``env.example`` changes."
msgstr ""
"``git pull``\\ 을 실행하여 저장소의 최근 변경 사항을 가져오되, 잠재적인 "
"``env.example`` 변경 사항에 유의하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:160
msgid ""
"Adjust the ``MATTERMOST_IMAGE_TAG`` in the ``.env`` file to point your "
"desired `enterprise <https://hub.docker.com/r/mattermost/mattermost-"
"enterprise-edition/tags?page=1&ordering=last_updated>`__ or `team "
"<https://hub.docker.com/r/mattermost/mattermost-team-"
"edition/tags?page=1&ordering=last_updated>`__ image version."
msgstr ""
"``.env`` 파일의 ``MATTERMOST_IMAGE_TAG``\\ 를 원하는 `enterprise "
"<https://hub.docker.com/r/mattermost/mattermost-enterprise-"
"edition/tags?page=1&ordering=last_updated>`__ 또는 `team "
"<https://hub.docker.com/r/mattermost/mattermost-team-"
"edition/tags?page=1&ordering=last_updated>`__ 이미지 버전을 가리키도록 "
"조정합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:164
msgid ""
"**For production environments**, we recommend using specific version tags"
" such as ``MATTERMOST_IMAGE_TAG=release-10.5`` rather than generic tags "
"like ``MATTERMOST_IMAGE_TAG=release-10``. Generic ``release-x`` tags are "
"intended for development use only and do not automatically receive new "
"patch releases within that major version. Using specific version tags "
"ensures a more reproducible and deterministic environment for your "
"production deployment."
msgstr ""
"**운영 환경의 경우**, ``MATTERMOST_IMAGE_TAG=release-10`` 같은 일반 태그보다 "
"``MATTERMOST_IMAGE_TAG=release-10.5`` 같은 특정 버전 태그를 사용할 것을 "
"권장합니다. 일반 ``release-x`` 태그는 개발용으로만 사용하도록 의도되었으며 해당 "
"메이저 버전 내의 새 패치 릴리스를 자동으로 받지 않습니다. 특정 버전 태그를 "
"사용하면 운영 배포를 위한 더 재현 가능하고 결정론적인 환경을 보장할 수 있습니다."

