#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:193
msgid "Troubleshooting PostgreSQL"
msgstr "PostgreSQL 문제 해결"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:195
msgid ""
"For quick start deployments, you can change the Postgres username and/or "
"password (recommended) in the ``.env`` file. If your database is managed "
"externally, you'll need to change the password in your database "
"management tool. Then, update the ``.env`` file with the new credentials."
msgstr ""
"빠른 시작 배포의 경우 ``.env`` 파일에서 Postgres 사용자 이름 및/또는 "
"비밀번호(권장)를 변경할 수 있습니다. 데이터베이스를 외부에서 관리하는 경우 "
"데이터베이스 관리 도구에서 비밀번호를 변경해야 합니다. 그런 다음 새 자격 증명으로 "
"``.env`` 파일을 업데이트하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:197
msgid "Troubleshooting TLS & NGINX"
msgstr "TLS 및 NGINX 문제 해결"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:199
msgid ""
"For an in-depth guide to configuring the TLS certificate and key for "
"Nginx, please refer to `this document in the repository "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/docker/blob/main/docs/issuing-letsencrypt-"
"certificate.md>`__."
msgstr ""
"Nginx용 TLS 인증서와 키 구성에 대한 자세한 가이드는 `저장소의 이 문서 "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/docker/blob/main/docs/issuing-letsencrypt-"
"certificate.md>`__\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:202
msgid "Trial Mattermost using Docker Preview"
msgstr "Docker Preview로 OKR.BEST 체험"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:204
msgid ""
"Looking for a way to evaluate Mattermost on a single local machine using "
"Docker? We recommend using the `Mattermost Docker Preview Image "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-docker-preview>`_ to install "
"Mattermost in Preview Mode."
msgstr ""
"Docker를 사용해 단일 로컬 머신에서 OKR.BEST를 평가할 방법을 찾고 있나요? "
"OKR.BEST를 프리뷰 모드로 설치하려면 `Mattermost Docker Preview Image "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-docker-preview>`_ 사용을 "
"권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:208
msgid ""
"This local image is self-contained (i.e., it has an internal database and"
" works out of the box). Dropping a container using this image removes "
"data and configuration as expected. You can see the :doc:`configuration "
"settings </administration-guide/configure/configuration-settings>` "
"documentation to learn more about customizing your trial deployment."
msgstr ""
"이 로컬 이미지는 자체 완결형입니다(즉, 내부 데이터베이스를 가지고 있으며 바로 "
"작동합니다). 이 이미지를 사용하는 컨테이너를 삭제하면 예상대로 데이터와 구성이 "
"제거됩니다. 체험 배포 사용자 지정에 대해 자세히 알아보려면 :doc:`구성 설정 "
"</administration-guide/configure/configuration-settings>` 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:209
msgid ""
"**Preview Mode** shouldn't be used in a production environment, as it "
"uses a known password string, contains other non-production configuration"
" settings, has email disabled, keeps no persistent data (all data lives "
"inside the container), and doesn't support upgrades."
msgstr ""
"**프리뷰 모드**\\ 는 알려진 비밀번호 문자열을 사용하고, 운영용이 아닌 다른 구성 "
"설정을 포함하며, 이메일이 비활성화되어 있고, 영구 데이터를 유지하지 않으며(모든 "
"데이터가 컨테이너 내부에 존재), 업그레이드를 지원하지 않으므로 운영 환경에서 "
"사용해서는 안 됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:210
msgid ""
"If you are planning to use the calling functionality in **Preview Mode** "
"on a non-local environment, you should ensure that the server is running "
"on a secure (HTTPs) connection and that the :ref:`network requirements "
"<administration-guide/configure/calls-rtcd-setup:network requirements>` "
"to run calls are met."
msgstr ""
"로컬이 아닌 환경에서 **프리뷰 모드**\\ 의 통화 기능을 사용할 계획이라면, 서버가 "
"보안(HTTPS) 연결로 실행 중이고 통화 실행을 위한 :ref:`네트워크 요구 사항 "
"<administration-guide/configure/calls-rtcd-setup:network requirements>`\\ 이 "
"충족되는지 확인해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:212
msgid "Install `Docker <https://www.docker.com/get-started/>`__."
msgstr "`Docker <https://www.docker.com/get-started/>`__\\ 를 설치합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:214
msgid "Once you have Docker, run the following command in a terminal window:"
msgstr "Docker가 준비되면 터미널 창에서 다음 명령을 실행합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:220
msgid ""
"When Docker is done fetching the image, navigate to "
"``http://localhost:8065/`` in your browser to preview Mattermost."
msgstr ""
"Docker가 이미지 가져오기를 마치면 브라우저에서 ``http://localhost:8065/``\\ 로 "
"이동하여 OKR.BEST를 미리 봅니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:221
msgid ""
"Select **Don't have an account** in the top right corner of the screen to"
" create an account for your preview instance. If you don't see this "
"option, ensure that the :ref:`Enable open server <administration-"
"guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings:enable open "
"server>` configuration setting is enabled. This setting is disabled for "
"self-hosted Mattermost deployments by default."
msgstr ""
"프리뷰 인스턴스의 계정을 만들려면 화면 오른쪽 상단의 **Don't have an "
"account**\\ 를 선택하세요. 이 옵션이 보이지 않으면 :ref:`Enable open server "
"<administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings:enable "
"open server>` 구성 설정이 활성화되어 있는지 확인하세요. 이 설정은 셀프 호스팅 "
"OKR.BEST 배포에서 기본적으로 비활성화되어 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:222
msgid "Log in to your preview instance with your user credentials."
msgstr "사용자 자격 증명으로 프리뷰 인스턴스에 로그인합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:225
msgid "Troubleshooting your preview deployment"
msgstr "프리뷰 배포 문제 해결"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:227
msgid ""
"The **Preview Mode** Docker instance for Mattermost is designed for "
"product evaluation, and sets ``SendEmailNotifications=false`` so the "
"product can function without enabling email. See the :doc:`Configuration "
"Settings </administration-guide/configure/configuration-settings>` "
"documentation to customize your deployment."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST용 **프리뷰 모드** Docker 인스턴스는 제품 평가를 위해 설계되었으며, 이메일을 "
"활성화하지 않고도 제품이 작동할 수 있도록 ``SendEmailNotifications=false``\\ 를 "
"설정합니다. 배포를 사용자 지정하려면 :doc:`구성 설정 </administration-guide"
"/configure/configuration-settings>` 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:229
msgid ""
"To update your Mattermost preview image and container, you must first "
"stop and delete your existing **mattermost-preview** container by running"
" the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 프리뷰 이미지와 컨테이너를 업데이트하려면, 먼저 다음 명령을 실행하여 기존 "
"**mattermost-preview** 컨테이너를 중지하고 삭제해야 합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:237
msgid ""
"Once the new image is pulled and the container is stopped and deleted you"
" need to run the ``docker run`` command from above."
msgstr ""
"새 이미지를 가져오고 컨테이너를 중지하고 삭제한 후에는 위의 ``docker run`` 명령을 "
"실행해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:240
msgid "On Linux, include ``sudo`` in front of all ``docker`` commands."
msgstr "Linux에서는 모든 ``docker`` 명령 앞에 ``sudo``\\ 를 포함하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:242
msgid "To access a shell inside the container, run the following command:"
msgstr "컨테이너 내부의 셸에 접근하려면 다음 명령을 실행합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:250
msgid ""
"See the :doc:`deployment troubleshooting </deployment-guide/deployment-"
"troubleshooting>` documentation for resolutions to common deployment "
"issues."
msgstr ""
"일반적인 배포 문제의 해결 방법은 :doc:`배포 문제 해결 </deployment-guide"
"/deployment-troubleshooting>` 문서를 참고하세요."

